        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7122-652, Spring Door Pivot Hinge Mortised</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer Industries has been in business since 1876, with over 125 years of quality products. Their products are American made with American steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 7122 Spring Door Pivot Hinge, Mortised Applied <b>(Both Top and Bottom pivots are mortised into the door)</b>. Cast Steel construction pivot hinge for doors up to 36\" wide, 2-1/2\" thick with a maximum door weight of 75 lbs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-spring-door-pivot-hinge-with-adjustable-tension-bommer-7112\"><b>Bommer 7112</b></a> Surface Mount Spring Door Pivot Hinge.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Adjustable Spring Mortise Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<!-- <li>Finish: <b>652: Satin Chrome</b></li> -->\r\n<li>Maximum Door Width: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Thickness: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 75 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Cast Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Mounted Pivots</li>\r\n<li>Double Acting</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing: 130º each direction</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearing Pivot</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Flat Door Bracket: For doors not less than 1\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Flat Jamb Bracket: 1-1/4\" Wide</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #12 - 1-1/4\" and #10 - 1\" Flat Head Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7122.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7122 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/bommer-spring-pivots-how-to-reactivate-spring-tension\"><b>How to Reactivate Tension on Bommer Spring Pivots</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually as a set, with 1 pivot , 1 each jamb and door bracket, 1 top pivot assembly with jamb bracket, and mounting screw hardware. Enough to do one door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b><font size=\"+2\">This Item is Discontinued<br>0 in stock</font></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n\r\n</p>",
